      "• **Revenue Model & Sustainability**: Moderate/Weak. The proposed subscription model for brands/suppliers is logical but common. The description lacks detail on pricing tiers, target customer lifetime value, or customer acquisition cost. The mention of 'exploring' optional upgrades for enterprises suggests the model is not fully fleshed out. Sustainability depends on achieving network effects which are not guaranteed.",
